      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing the relative fractions of Al and Ti will improve the tribo-corrosion resistance of the HEA.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "An as-sintered CrMnFeCoNi-type baseline HEA has a simple solid-solution phase.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The baseline HEA lacks sufficient concentrations of engineered oxide-forming elements.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed material is applicable to sliding tribo-corrosion at approximately 400°C in 3.5 wt% NaCl solution.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "AlCoCrFeNiTi0.5 exhibits increased reciprocating-wear resistance at elevated temperature due to formation of a protective oxide layer under atmospheric conditions.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective scale formed by the optimized alloy consists primarily of Al2O3 and TiO2.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide scale is continuous, stable, and adherent during high-temperature sliding.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Higher Al and Ti concentrations cause rapid formation of the proposed passivating oxide film.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide film limits direct exposure of the metallic substrate to the environment.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide film reduces mechanical material loss during elevated-temperature sliding.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide film reduces chemical corrosion and the synergistic material loss caused by combined wear and corrosion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimized HEA will have lower wear volume than a non-optimized HEA under identical tribo-corrosion conditions.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7515071::chunk::000::abstract::cd6baea278"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimized HEA will have lower corrosion current density than a non-optimized HEA under identical tribo-corrosion conditions.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The optimized HEA will outperform conventional structural alloys in high-temperature tribo-corrosion resistance.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
